Release v1.2.0:
- Performance speedup in all systems due to query output caching,
  necessary due to intrinsic delays in IPC processes.
- The ability to access external (non-DES) databases from DESODBC is
  removed due to its lack of utility and unsolvable consistency and
  performance issues.
- Solved bugs on:
	- Queries with "with" clauses

Release v1.1.0:
- Performance speedup in Windows.
- Complete support in MSAccess, LibreOffice Base, DES.
- Support in importing tables to SQL Server.
- Solved bugs on:
	- Windows mutexes
	- Inconsistencies in data types
	- Multiple columns with shared name